WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.535 align:start position:0%
Good to see you,
old boy.

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:04.670
- Yes.
- How was Kenya?

00:00:04.703 --> 00:00:07.240 align:end position:100%
I love Kenya.
Absolutely adore the place.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.642 align:end position:100%
You know,
it's so important

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:10.877 align:end position:100%
to protect them,
you know...

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:11.911 align:start position:0%
Indeed.

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.646 align:end position:100%
The few untouched
tribes left.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:14.881
- Indeed.
- Yes.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.249 align:start size:47% position:53%
And while we're
on the subject,

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.217 align:end position:100%
I've got something
of a confession to make.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.919 align:start position:0%
Oh, dear.

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.587 align:end position:100%
While I was down there,
I caught the attention

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.722 align:start size:72% position:28%
of a young Masai woman.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:23.890 align:start position:0%
You didn't.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.924 align:end position:100%
She took me
for an exotic,

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:27.060 align:end position:100%
sophisticated superman
of sorts

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.761 align:end position:100%
and developed something
of a liking to me.

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.763 align:start position:0%
Well, isn't that
always the way?

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:32.265 align:start size:34% position:66%
Yes, it is.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:33.933 align:end position:100%
And it's quite awful,
Gerald.

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:35.334 align:start size:72% position:28%
She came down to my hut

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.703 align:end position:100%
wearing nothing
but a fertility headdress

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:39.539 align:end position:100%
and carrying
a husband stick,

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:43.042 align:end position:100%
and, oh, I had to participate
in the customs.

00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:44.710 align:start position:0%
Well, it would be
morally irresponsible

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:46.212 align:start position:0%
if you did not participate
in the custom.

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:48.748 align:start position:0%
You could destroy
their entire social structure.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:50.616 align:end position:100%
Oh, I felt so terrible
about it.

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:52.385 align:start position:0%
Of course
you did, Gerald.

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:55.521
- I felt terrible seven times.
- Oh, dreadful.

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:57.223 align:start position:0%
But, you know, Gerald,
I, too, have a confession.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:58.624 align:start size:25% position:75%
Do tell.

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:00.026 size:81% position:41%
Remember several years ago
when I went to the Amazon?

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.594
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:03.629 size:84% position:42%
Well, I accidentally packed
a lighter in my satchel.

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:05.064 align:start size:22% position:78%
Oh, my.

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:07.600 align:start position:0%
Yes, well, one day,
I absent-mindedly lit the flint,

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:09.268 align:start position:0%
and the entire village
took me for a god.

00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:10.403
- Oh, no.
- Yes.

00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:11.938 align:start position:0%
Every sundown,
as I was being fellated

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.539 align:start position:0%
by all the young women
of the village,

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:15.241 size:81% position:41%
which is the local custom,

00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:19.445 align:start position:0%
I felt completely embarrassed
by the entire affair.

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:22.715 align:end position:100%
I can only imagine
in some vivid detail,

00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:25.985 align:end position:100%
but you can't deny
the local custom.

00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:27.787 align:start position:0%
You absolutely cannot deny
the local customs.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.256
(both)
You can't deny
the local customs.

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:33.459 align:start position:0%
One thing you must do
is adhere to the local customs.

00:01:33.492 --> 00:01:34.594 align:start size:34% position:66%
[muttering]

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:35.828 align:start position:0%
You must adhere
to the local customs.

00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:37.797
[both muttering]

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.165 align:start position:0%
[muttering]
You must adhere
to the local customs.

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:41.334 align:end position:100%
Local customs
must not be denied!

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.603 align:start position:0%
It's, oh, the least
one can do.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.339 align:end position:100%
It all reminds me of the time
I was in Papua New Guinea

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.641 align:end position:100%
and I introduced the local tribe
to the French term

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:50.343 align:start size:50% position:50%
<i> ménage à trois.</i>

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.145 align:end position:100%
After that evening,
a couple of the local men

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:56% position:44%
called me "Papua."

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:54.580 align:start position:0%
Oh, dear.

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:57.016 align:start position:0%
Whoops-a-daisy!

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.017 align:start position:0%
[imitates explosion]

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.852 align:end position:100%
Whoops-a-daisy,
indeed.

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:02.755
It's getting harder and harder
to protect the local tribes

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:05.158 align:end position:100%
from the influence
of the outside civilizations.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.994 align:start position:0%
I know exactly what you mean,
old boy, exactly,

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.529 align:start position:0%
and I must confess
that the last time

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.863 align:start position:0%
I was deep in the bush
in Australia...

00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:11.998 align:start size:13% position:88%
Yes?

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start position:0%
I ended up deep in bush
in Australia.

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.034 align:start size:25% position:75%
Boo-yah.

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:16.536 align:start position:0%
Well, where are you
off to now, old boy?

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.171 align:start size:63% position:38%
I'm off to Tanzania.

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:20.640 align:start position:0%
Tanzania--make sure
that you go during an eclipse,

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.708 align:start position:0%
because then everyone
will want to have sex with you.

00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:23.709
(both)
Mm.

00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:25.311 align:start position:0%
Hmm.

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:26.546 align:start size:31% position:69%
[chuckles]

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:27.547
(both)
Regrettably.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.246
[both muttering, humming]

